clean-english-v2 fixture package

The WAV, original transcript and fixture metadata in this package are offered
under GPL-3.0-or-later. See clean-english-v2.COPYING for the
complete license. This is a conservative licensing choice covering any included
GPL-covered synthesis data; it is not a claim that GPL always covers tool output.

The original wrapper generate-clean-english-v2.py is separately licensed
MIT OR Apache-2.0 under the project license texts. It invokes development tools
as separate processes and does not copy their implementation into the wrapper.

